An independent ZIP-framing application now emits deterministic ordinary
stored-only archives from caller-provided sorted member names and payloads.
It preflights all names, byte budgets and ZIP32 sentinel limits before one
output allocation. Golden `struct`/`zlib`/`zipfile` bytes and strict reader
