member name and payload byte; invalid frames fail with existing typed errors.
The writer still offers no typed manifest or canonical JSON serialization.

A second immutable multi-member ZIP SHA-256 golden now records an archive
independently verified with Python's standard `zipfile` reader and SHA library,
