CRC-checked ZIP framing now also retains a read-only, non-authorizing marker
for the fixed header metadata that Atrament's deterministic stored writer emits.
A legacy ordinary stored ZIP with older version fields, missing ASCII UTF-8
flag or nonzero timestamps remains readable but cannot claim matching writer
